  <datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">"This creation myth was written by Connie Nettles when she was 13. Her sister Bea designed this book and had it printed at the Visual Studies Workshop on a small offset press. Additional pages were screen printed on mylar. The small book's cover is a velvet textured paper and the book is encased in a machine stitched vinyl slipcase with a water swirl pattern."</subfield>
